  <prompt>Close the project: run the mandatory /test-diet gate, report publish size against the baseline, verify the graduation criteria, write lessons-learned, and update the portfolio and registries.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer closing a project per root CLAUDE.md §7.</role>
  <goal>Every graduation criterion in spec.md verified or explicitly waived, with the project's records left accurate for the next reader.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Root CLAUDE.md §7 makes /test-diet a mandatory gate at 090. The distinguishing graduation criterion is #12: introduce a deliberate ninth secret-bearing confidential client on a scratch branch and confirm the build FAILS. Everything else is table stakes; that one is what makes this project different from the three that preceded it.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">projects/spaarke-auth-v4-dataverse-MI/README.md</file>
      <file role="modify">projects/INDEX.md</file>
      <file role="new">projects/spaarke-auth-v4-dataverse-MI/notes/lessons-learned.md</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies><dependency task="all" status="pending">All workstreams complete</dependency></dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">Scope: /test-diet is MANDATORY and read-only — it emits git rm / git mv commands for the reviewer, it does not auto-execute.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Scope: graduation criterion 12 must be EXERCISED, not asserted. Seed a violation on a scratch branch and confirm the build fails.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Scope: report publish size against the 44.96 MB incl. PDBs net10 baseline, stating the PDB convention.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Scope: close out the cross-project items — confirm task 030 landed for provisioning, and record whether the Model 2 tenancy question was answered.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Scope: .claude/ and projects/INDEX.md edits are main-session only.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>Project closure, test diet, portfolio</topic>
    <files>
      <file>.claude/skills/test-diet/SKILL.md</file>
      <file>.claude/skills/context-handoff/SKILL.md</file>
      <file>projects/spaarke-auth-v4-dataverse-MI/spec.md</file>
      <file>.claude/constraints/azure-deployment.md</file>
    </files>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step>Run /test-diet; produce notes/test-diet-report.md.</step>
    <step>Exercise graduation criterion 12 on a scratch branch; record the build failure as evidence.</step>
    <step>Measure and report publish size + delta vs 44.96 MB; run the CVE scan.</step>
    <step>Walk every graduation criterion in spec.md; mark verified or explicitly waived with a reason.</step>
    <step>Write lessons-learned, centring the false-premise root cause and whether the forcing functions actually hold.</step>
    <step>Update README status, projects/INDEX.md, and the portfolio Issue #800 (Status, Tasks Completed, Closed Date).</step>
    <step>Confirm cross-project close-out with both sibling projects.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
    <trigger>Graduation criterion 12 does NOT fail the build — STOP. The project's central deliverable has not been achieved and the wrap-up cannot proceed.</trigger>
    <trigger>/test-diet proposes deleting the forcing functions despite task 063 — STOP and resolve; that is the exact regression 063 exists to prevent.</trigger>
  </escalation>

  <outputs>
    <output type="new">projects/spaarke-auth-v4-dataverse-MI/notes/lessons-learned.md</output>
    <output type="new">projects/spaarke-auth-v4-dataverse-MI/notes/test-diet-report.md</output>
    <output type="modify">projects/spaarke-auth-v4-dataverse-MI/README.md</output>
    <output type="modify">projects/INDEX.md</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion>/test-diet run; report committed; the forcing functions classified MAINTAIN.</criterion>
    <criterion>Graduation criterion 12 EXERCISED — a seeded ninth secret-bearing client fails the build, with evidence.</criterion>
    <criterion>Publish size + delta reported against 44.96 MB with the PDB convention stated; no new HIGH CVE.</criterion>
    <criterion>Every spec.md graduation criterion is marked verified or explicitly waived with a reason.</criterion>
    <criterion>lessons-learned.md written.</criterion>
    <criterion>README, projects/INDEX.md and portfolio Issue #800 updated.</criterion>
    <criterion>Negative case: no graduation criterion is marked complete without evidence.</criterion>
    <criterion>Cross-project close-out confirmed with customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1 and dataverse-access-unification-r1.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
</task>
